        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Visiting the dentist can be a nerve-wracking experience, but at Valley Village Dental we go the extra mile to ensure your comfort from the moment you arrive. We combine state-of-the-art dentistry along with a family-focused atmosphere to offer you a gentle and comfortable visit. Our team takes the time to listen to your concerns and we discuss the treatments that best meet your overall health and financial priorities.",
